│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ bottleneck_targeted_annealing                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ The key weakness of the current code is that its hill climber moves one uniformly random  │
│                          │ point at a time, wasting most of its budget on points that have no effect on the smallest │
│                          │ triangle. Expert knowledge of the Heilbronn problem says the objective is controlled by   │
│                          │ the "bottleneck" — the few smallest-area triangles — and improving them requires moving   │
│                          │ the nearly-collinear triples themselves (often all three vertices, or the middle point    │
│                          │ perpendicular to the line through the other two). I propose: (1) target the perturbation  │
│                          │ at the vertex(s) of the current smallest triangle (with occasional perpendicular escape   │
│                          │ moves that directly reduce near-collinearity), (2) accept simulated-annealing style       │
│                          │ downhill moves so the search can escape local optima, (3) extend the time budget to 3.0s  │
│                          │ (eval_time is a secondary metric and the previous 3s program scored best), and (4) add a  │
│                          │ ring+center seed (12-gon + center), which is a strong structural prior for n=13. These    │
│                          │ changes are deterministic (fixed seed) and preserve the existing score/geometry           │
│                          │ machinery.                                                                                │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0054                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ z-ai/glm-5.3                                                                              │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low'}                                                                         │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 31; deleted: 0; modified: 18;                                                      │
