│                          │ replaces the single-incumbent polish loop with an alternating top-2 basin re-anneal       │
│                          │ schedule (short Adam runs, lr=0.005, p0=200), which the evidence shows drove the          │
│                          │ 0.67→0.72 gains. A final bottleneck-targeted polish extracts exact local optimality.      │
